<title>POLAND: CELULOZA JULY NET RISES TO PLN 7.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>CELULOZA JULY NET RISES TO PLN 7.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     7.61 vs   7.22</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	10.33 vs   9.03</p>
<p> Operating profit    10.43 vs   7.45</p>
<p> Sales		   61.33 vs  62.38</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    28.02 vs  58.23</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	41.41 vs  99.30</p>
<p> Operating profit    43.18 vs  89.38</p>
<p> Sales		  397.96 vs 424.12</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish paper maker is Celuloza Swiecie SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
